CORE
main.c
--show-local-safe-pointers _ --no-standard-checks
activate-multi-line-match
^EXIT=0$
^SIGNAL=0$
Non-null expressions: \{main::1::p\}\n\s+// \d+ file main\.c line 6 function main\n\s+ASSIGN main::1::x := \*main::1::p
Non-null expressions: \{\}\n\s+// \d+ file main\.c line 7 function main\n\s+ASSIGN main::1::x := main::1::x \+ 1
--
^warning: ignoring
--
p is known to be non-null only where the condition p != 0 holds.
